    {
      "id": "cissia-ultimate-ophidiophobia",
      "source": "ultimate",
      "sourceId": "cissia-ultimate",
      "label": "Ophidiophobia - Ether Veil: Cold-Blooded (Ultimate)",
      "description": "... After using this skill, activate Ether Veil: Cold-Blooded, lasting 30s. All squad members' CRIT DMG increases by 5% for the duration. Re-activating Ether Veil: Cold-Blooded a second time will first deactivate the active Ether Veil: Cold-Blooded. ...",
