        "name": "Fatal Concoction - Corrode Bone (Core Passive)",
        "description": "Upon entering the battlefield, gain 3 /bVenom//b. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180s. While possessing /bVenom//b, consume 1 /bVenom//b every 5s while in combat to trigger /bCorrode Bone//b, dealing Electric DMG.\n\nWith /bVenom//b, the squad's Electric DMG ignores 6% of enemy DEF. If initial Energy Regen is higher than 1.4, for every additional 0.12 above that threshold, an additional 1% of the enemy's DEF is ignored, up to a maximum of 25% of enemy DEF. This effect lasts until 30s after /bVenom//b is depleted.\n\n/bCorrode Bone//b deals additional Electric DMG equal to 335% of ATK. When there are 1/2 Electric characters in the squad, the Daze dealt by /bCorrode Bone//b increases by 40%/60%. When gaining /bVenom//b, every 1 excess point of /bVenom//b triggers /bCorrode Bone//b once.",
